{
  "duration": 49.979,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.159,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.759,
      "end": 2.859,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.5,
      "end": 4.259,
      "text": "Now in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.839,
      "end": 7.919,
      "text": "we are given that a car is moving at twenty meters per second."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.439,
      "end": 11.779,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find its speed in kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.319,
      "end": 12.799,
      "text": "Now first,"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.34,
      "end": 14.819,
      "text": "let us note down the given value."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.339,
      "end": 18.019,
      "text": "Speed of the car is twenty meters per second."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.52,
      "end": 21.0,
      "text": "We need to find the speed in kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.539,
      "end": 24.079,
      "text": "We should know one important conversion."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.659,
      "end": 27.819,
      "text": "To convert meter per second into kilometer per hour,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.539,
      "end": 30.299,
      "text": "we multiply by eighteen by five,"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.679,
      "end": 32.059,
      "text": "or simply three point six."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.439,
      "end": 34.899,
      "text": "Now let us substitute the given value."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.5,
      "end": 39.859,
      "text": "Twenty meters per second is equal to twenty into eighteen by five kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.479,
      "end": 49.979,
      "text": "After simplifying this, we get seventy-two kilometers per hour. Therefore, the speed of the car is seventy-two kilometers per hour. Hence, the final answer is option C."
    }
  ],
